Package: vaani
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Vaani Project <vaani@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-venv, python3-tk
Recommends: pulseaudio | pipewire-pulse, ollama
Suggests: nvidia-cuda-toolkit
Description: Real-time Hindi/Hinglish to English voice translation assistant
 Vaani is a local, privacy-preserving desktop application that provides
 real-time voice translation from Hindi and Hinglish to English,
 with meeting takeover capabilities.
